sequenceDiagram
    participant User as "Logistics Manager"
    participant WebApp as "Web Application<br/>(React.js)"
    participant APIGateway as "API Gateway<br/>(Kong)"
    participant TrackingService as "Tracking Service<br/>(Node.js)"
    participant EventService as "Event Processing<br/>(Java Spring Boot)"
    participant AIService as "AI Prediction<br/>(Python/TensorFlow)"
    participant AlertService as "Alert Service<br/>(Node.js)"
    participant Kafka as "Message Broker<br/>(Apache Kafka)"
    participant PostgreSQL as "PostgreSQL<br/>(Primary DB)"
    participant MongoDB as "MongoDB<br/>(Events DB)"
    participant Redis as "Redis<br/>(Cache)"
    participant External as "External Systems<br/>(Ports/Warehouses)"

    Note over User,External: Shipment Creation and Tracking Flow
    User->>WebApp: Create new shipment
    WebApp->>APIGateway: POST /shipments
    APIGateway->>APIGateway: Authenticate & Rate Limit
    APIGateway->>TrackingService: Forward request
    TrackingService->>PostgreSQL: Insert shipment record
    PostgreSQL-->>TrackingService: Shipment created
    TrackingService->>Kafka: Publish ShipmentCreated event
    TrackingService-->>APIGateway: 201 Created response
    APIGateway-->>WebApp: Shipment details
    WebApp-->>User: Display confirmation

    Note over User,External: Real-time Event Processing Flow
    External->>APIGateway: POST /shipments/{id}/events
    APIGateway->>EventService: Forward logistics event
    EventService->>MongoDB: Store event data
    EventService->>Kafka: Publish LogisticsEvent
    Kafka->>AIService: Consume event for analysis
    AIService->>AIService: Run delay prediction model
    AIService->>PostgreSQL: Store prediction results
    AIService->>Kafka: Publish PredictionGenerated event
    Kafka->>AlertService: Consume prediction event
    AlertService->>AlertService: Evaluate alert rules
    alt Delay Predicted
        AlertService->>PostgreSQL: Create alert record
        AlertService->>Kafka: Publish AlertGenerated event
        AlertService->>User: Send notification (email/SMS)
    end
    EventService-->>APIGateway: 200 OK
    APIGateway-->>External: Event processed

    Note over User,External: Dashboard Analytics Query Flow
    User->>WebApp: View dashboard
    WebApp->>APIGateway: GET /dashboard/analytics
    APIGateway->>TrackingService: Request analytics data
    TrackingService->>Redis: Check cache
    alt Cache Hit
        Redis-->>TrackingService: Return cached data
    else Cache Miss
        TrackingService->>PostgreSQL: Query shipment data
        TrackingService->>MongoDB: Query event data
        PostgreSQL-->>TrackingService: Shipment metrics
        MongoDB-->>TrackingService: Event metrics
        TrackingService->>TrackingService: Aggregate analytics
        TrackingService->>Redis: Cache results (TTL: 5min)
    end
    TrackingService-->>APIGateway: Analytics response
    APIGateway-->>WebApp: Dashboard data
    WebApp-->>User: Display analytics

    Note over User,External: AI Prediction Request Flow
    User->>WebApp: Request delay prediction
    WebApp->>APIGateway: GET /predictions?shipmentId={id}
    APIGateway->>AIService: Forward prediction request
    AIService->>Redis: Check prediction cache
    alt Cache Hit
        Redis-->>AIService: Return cached prediction
    else Cache Miss
        AIService->>PostgreSQL: Fetch shipment details
        AIService->>MongoDB: Fetch historical events
        PostgreSQL-->>AIService: Shipment data
        MongoDB-->>AIService: Event history
        AIService->>AIService: Run ML model inference
        AIService->>AIService: Generate explainability (SHAP)
        AIService->>Redis: Cache prediction (TTL: 1hr)
        AIService->>PostgreSQL: Store prediction record
    end
    AIService-->>APIGateway: Prediction with confidence score
    APIGateway-->>WebApp: Prediction results
    WebApp-->>User: Display prediction & explanation

    Note over User,External: Alert Acknowledgment Flow
    User->>WebApp: Acknowledge alert
    WebApp->>APIGateway: POST /alerts/{id}/acknowledge
    APIGateway->>AlertService: Forward acknowledgment
    AlertService->>PostgreSQL: Update alert status
    AlertService->>Kafka: Publish AlertAcknowledged event
    PostgreSQL-->>AlertService: Alert updated
    AlertService-->>APIGateway: 200 OK
    APIGateway-->>WebApp: Acknowledgment confirmed
    WebApp-->>User: Display success message